posts.text:
Republicans have one job…

@LisaMarieBoothe: “They need to look Americans in the eye and say—we’ve made your lives more affordable. If they can’t say that credibly, Republicans will lose.”

Video

Support for the war has a short window…

@MattTowery: “People don’t support war for very long… Gas prices are rising, so this has to end quickly. But MAGA voters are still sticking with Trump—for now—to see if he can get it done.”

Video

Democrats are sacrificing American workers…

@SenEricSchmitt: “They care more about illegal immigrants than TSA agents… These workers have missed up to 50% of their paychecks—and Democrats are willing to do that just to defund ICE.”

Video

Iran is just flexing…

@thomasbsauer: “They have no real offensive capability—if they did, we’d see it. The reality is, we’ve got all the cards and Iran has very few to play right now.”

Video

Iran is trying to run the clock…

@AmbNathanSales: “They think Trump will get distracted or pivot under pressure—but they fundamentally misunderstand him. His policy has been consistent from day one: Iran can’t have nukes or threaten the U.S.”

Video

Biden left a total disaster…

@HawleyMO: “His instincts were wrong on everything—from the border to Ukraine to Iran… And now you see a completely different approach. Our military has shown unmatched superiority in just three weeks.”

Video

In California, low-polling Democrats changed the rules…

@SteveHiltonx: “They’re on 2, 3, 4 percent, then claim it’s about race… It’s not. They’re not doing well enough in the race. Activist groups pressured USC—and they caved.”

Video

In California, we’re so high on DEI…

@adamcarolla: “We have the first, first, first… Fine—let’s have the best. When tragedy strikes, you need competent people. We don’t have that at any level in Los Angeles.”

Video

In California, there’s no course correction…

@adamcarolla: “Newsom has so much hubris—he won’t listen. People are voting with their U-Hauls and their wallets… and the ones getting crushed are working-class guys paying seven bucks a gallon just to do their jobs.”

Video

With Iran, the situation is EXTREMELY FLUID…

@robert_spalding: “We could be negotiating with the wrong people—or the right people. It really depends… and as this war goes on, who’s actually in charge could change.”

Video

Illegal immigration is INTEGRAL to the Democrats’ agenda…

@VDHanson: “If you follow this logic, you don’t have immigration laws at all… They know their agenda can’t get 51%, so they either change voting laws—or bring in a new constituency. They’ve done all three.”

Video

